      912              b-iv  b-ev  b-rv  b-em  b-wm  b-im b-ap b-pc b-mp
      913              b-ieh b-eeh b-eph b-reh
      914              b-OK
      915       with frame fr-D-obj-rsn.
      916     end.
      917     enable b-Exit b-help b-History with frame fr-D-obj-rsn.
