     1099                                rsn-pc  rsn-ieh rsn-eeh rsn-eph rsn-reh .
     1100     find first ub.trn-reason no-lock where
     1101                ub.trn-reason.reason-code = rsn-ie no-error.
     1102       find first ub.trn-reason-obj exclusive-lock where
     1103                  ub.trn-reason-obj.obj-type     = p-obj-type  and
     1104                  ub.trn-reason-obj.obj-code     = p-obj-code  and
